cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper (preferred-citation) and, where relevant, the dataset DOI."
title: "plm_choice: a benchmarking framework for protein language model embeddings"
abstract: |
  Analysis code accompanying the manuscript "Which pLM to choose?". The framework
  systematically compares protein language model (pLM) embeddings against sequence,
  structure and function similarity targets across multiple probe architectures
  (feed-forward, linear, linear-on-difference, and training-free distance baselines).
